<title>INDIA: Indian interbank term money rates - April 21.</title>
<headline>Indian interbank term money rates - April 21.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are indicative quotes (in percent) for interbank term money on April 21:</p>
<p> TERM					  BID/ASK</p>
<p> -----------------		    -------------</p>
<p>   30  DAYS				 4.50-6.00</p>
<p>   60  DAYS				 5.50-6.50</p>
<p>   90  DAYS				 6.50-7.50</p>
<p>  180  DAYS				 8.50-10.00</p>
<p>    1 YEAR				  9.00-10.00</p>
<p>--</p>
<p>The indicative term money rates are based on contributions from various banks.</p>
<p>For contributions contact Bombay money desk on (022) 265 9000</p>
</text>
